# Build-context excludes — keep the 3.6 GB repo from being shipped to the daemon +
# chown -R'd on every build. ONLY paths that are never needed inside the image are
# listed here (caches, vcs, logs, build artifacts). The big win — data/historical
# (2.3 GB) — is NOT excluded yet: it is bind-mounted on only 5 of 14 services, so
# removing it from the image could break a service that reads /app/data/historical
# without mounting it. Verify that before adding `data/historical/` here.
.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.log
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
.env.bak*
.codegraph/
